        <tr><td><code>FinancialMetricsResponse</code></td><td>models.py</td><td>BaseModel</td><td>API response wrapper for financial-metrics endpoint</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>Cache</code></td><td>cache.py</td><td>Class</td><td>In-memory dict cache with separate stores per data type</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>get_cache()</code></td><td>cache.py</td><td>Function</td><td>Global singleton accessor — returns the one Cache instance</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>_merge_data()</code></td><td>cache.py</td><td>Method</td><td>Deduplication merge for list data using date/id keys</td></tr>
